title ALES51 — Lotus's noise gate: the compressor's threshold inverted
prompt take the next agent-doable Lindy-first crux-first lap, self-approve the design round, send each finished increment to origin and xykj61, stop only at the custody gates in REMEMBER
think ALES49 opened dynamics with the brickwall limiter and ALES50 softened it into the compressor. Lindy-first, crux-first, the next durable rung is the one the ALES50 witness itself named — invert the threshold into a gate: where the compressor leans on what rises ABOVE the threshold, the gate leans on what falls BELOW it, silencing the hiss between words, the amp hum, the room tone in a pause. It completes the dynamics family's loud-and-quiet halves.
think Design: gate(clip, start, count, threshold, ratio_num, ratio_den) with ratio >= 1 — the exact mirror of compress. Below threshold, new_m = m·ratio_den/ratio_num (i64 divTrunc); at or above threshold, identity. Since ratio >= 1 the quotient <= m <= sample_max, so nothing on the audio path overflows, no saturate needed.
think Crux chosen: unit ratio (ratio_num == ratio_den) is the identity EVERYWHERE (m·1 = |x| even below threshold) — the gate's counterpart to the compressor's unit-ratio identity; a higher ratio gates at least as hard (monotone); and a ratio far past the magnitude divides it to zero, dropping the quiet exactly to silence — the hard gate reached from within the downward expander.
obs Ratio params are u32 (num >= den, den nonzero) — a sub-unity ratio would BOOST the quiet (a different tool) so it refuses BadRatio; threshold in [1, sample_max] else BadThreshold; span BadRange coincides by name with timeline/EQ/limiter/compressor. All checks before any write. The gate is compress.rye reflected: m > thr → reduce excess became m < thr → reduce whole magnitude; below-is-identity became above-is-identity.
obs GREEN on the first build across seven clauses; ALES50 compressor re-run stays GREEN, so the inverted floor rests beside the softened ceiling. TAME bans clean; lotus/gate.rye carries plenty of asserts (not on the zero-assert ratchet). Third dynamics rung of the arc (ALES49·50·51), each sent as its own signed round to origin and xykj61.
loom witness=ales_gate_witness green=1 clauses=7 family=dynamics rung=ALES51 reuses=timeline,compress
file lotus/gate.rye the noise gate — pass at/above threshold, divide the below-threshold magnitude by the ratio, unit ratio the identity, high ratio the hard gate
file tools/ales_gate_witness.rish builds, runs the selftest, asserts GREEN ales-gate, re-proves ALES50 compressor green
file active-designing/20260814-171918_fill-ales51-lotus-noise-gate.md the self-approved design round for ALES51
file lotus/README.md front door synced — the ALES51 noise-gate sentence and the status header
recommend keep-going the dynamics family now holds the brickwall (ALES49), the softened ratio (ALES50), and the inverted floor (ALES51); the next natural crux is an attack/hold/release envelope that gives all three a real time base, or a soft knee that rounds the threshold's corner
